WEBVTT

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:53.094
Contaminoids are currently
approaching the lower section of the city.

00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:57.724
We will be delaying departure in order
to put the safety of our passengers first.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:01.978
This vessel has been designed
to withstand contaminoid attack.

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:06.649
Thus, we ask that you please
remain calm and stay in your seats.

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:56.741
Are you all right? Don't go
getting nervous or anything.

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:58.034
Your stomach doesn't hurt, does it?

00:01:58.034 --> 00:01:59.661
Just relax. Relax...

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:02.038
Quit being such a bleeding heart!

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:03.206
If you're fightin' contaminoids,

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:06.334
all you gotta do is dash out
there and <i>wham</i>, stick it to 'em right?

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:07.669
Insufficient!

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:09.921
You must strike them with a <i>bam</i>! A <i>bam</i>!

00:02:09.921 --> 00:02:13.341
If you are a Heaven's Blade,
in battle with the contaminoids

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:15.176
you will grant no quarter, show no mercy!

00:02:15.176 --> 00:02:17.345
Utilize your strength and
techniques to the utmost

00:02:17.345 --> 00:02:20.223
for an absolute, crushing victory!

00:03:30.335 --> 00:03:33.963
Getting a named sixth-stager
to polish your skills with...

00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:38.343
It would seem Her Majesty
expects a great deal of you.

00:03:38.343 --> 00:03:39.969
Restoration.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.393
Mighty Pierce and Smash...

00:03:46.393 --> 00:03:48.019
Ripping Fang!

00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:00.407
You idiots! Move!

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:10.417
That was rather excessive.

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:13.670
I guess that's why that old, half-dead crone

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.463
told us to fight in the outer
areas rather than outside.

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:18.717
I can hear you, Lintens.

00:04:20.969 --> 00:04:24.139
Inbeeku has begun to regenerate.

00:04:29.477 --> 00:04:31.521
That's just lovely.

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:50.123
External Ballistic Kei...

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:51.541
Tempered Transformation!

00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:53.168
Serpent Wave!

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:10.393
<i>It's already been decided.</i>

00:05:10.393 --> 00:05:11.853
"The Conscious City"
<i>It's already been decided.</i>

00:05:11.853 --> 00:05:13.521
"The Conscious City"
<i>It can't be undone.</i>

00:05:13.521 --> 00:05:15.690
"The Conscious City"
<i>Nor would anyone want it to be.</i>

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.193
<i>Not Her Majesty, and not me. </i>

00:05:25.033 --> 00:05:27.118
<i>I want it.</i>

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.915
<i>Is my wanting it alone not enough?</i>

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.836
--Wait. Just wait a minute!
--Huh?

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:03.340
If you quit, what will happen to the 17th Platoon?!

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:07.093
Having it disband would make the
decision easier for you as leader, right?

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:10.805
Using your talents in another unit
would be in Zuellni's best interest.

00:07:10.805 --> 00:07:13.183
At least give me till the end of the competition.

00:07:13.183 --> 00:07:16.519
Just watch, I'll change how you feel by then.

00:07:16.519 --> 00:07:18.355
You exaggerate.

00:07:20.065 --> 00:07:21.691
Restoration.

00:07:24.527 --> 00:07:27.739
Once I've turned in my badge,
this won't be some training exercise.

00:07:29.407 --> 00:07:33.078
I'm unarmed, so if something happens to me,
the platoon will be immediately dissolved!

00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:35.413
Wait!

00:07:35.413 --> 00:07:36.831
Calm down, Nina!

00:07:36.831 --> 00:07:38.958
Let go of me, Harley!

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.502
This isn't like you.

00:07:40.502 --> 00:07:44.798
I can't let our platoon be
disbanded, not now! Let go!

00:07:50.053 --> 00:07:52.138
Bang.

00:07:52.138 --> 00:07:54.599
All we have to do is replace him, right?

00:07:54.599 --> 00:07:57.811
Today's the entrance ceremony, so
there'll be someone who can take his place.

00:07:57.811 --> 00:08:02.732
Senior Sharnid, please help us too. You
can even use your specialty, picking up girls.

00:08:02.732 --> 00:08:05.360
I would heartily welcome
some <i>male </i>squad members.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.986
Liar.

00:08:09.572 --> 00:08:11.408
There they are!

00:08:15.537 --> 00:08:18.623
New students, please
assemble at the main auditorium.

00:08:18.623 --> 00:08:20.709
Wa-hoooo!

00:08:20.709 --> 00:08:22.419
Uh, that's scary.

00:08:22.419 --> 00:08:25.714
That one! How about that one?!
I could use him on defense!

00:08:25.714 --> 00:08:28.800
Look at his uniform. He's not in
the Military Arts Department, is he?

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.676
Then <i>him</i>!

00:08:29.676 --> 00:08:31.845
He's already been scouted by another platoon.

00:08:31.845 --> 00:08:32.387
--And him?!

00:08:32.387 --> 00:08:33.888
--Ditto.
--And him?!

00:08:33.888 --> 00:08:36.641
What the hell?! There's no one even here!

00:08:36.641 --> 00:08:40.437
It looks like most of the good ones
are already committed to a platoon.

00:08:40.437 --> 00:08:41.271
See?

00:08:41.271 --> 00:08:42.480
We're counting on you.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.983
What's more, I wonder if
any new student with a future

00:08:44.983 --> 00:08:48.403
would even join our sad little platoon.

00:08:48.403 --> 00:08:49.779
You sound like this doesn't concern you.

00:08:49.779 --> 00:08:51.114
Now now.

00:08:51.114 --> 00:08:53.033
He's in Military Arts, right?!

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:59.289
Dinn. Sorry, but I saw him first.

00:08:59.289 --> 00:09:02.709
It seems you've forgotten all about
what happened that time long ago.

00:09:02.709 --> 00:09:03.793
What?

00:09:03.793 --> 00:09:07.380
Think you have the right to
say something like that, maggot?

00:09:10.884 --> 00:09:12.510
Dinn!

00:09:18.475 --> 00:09:20.185
Don't let it get to you, Nina.

00:09:20.185 --> 00:09:22.020
Yeah, I know.

00:09:25.273 --> 00:09:28.610
Let's go somewhere else. There
are still lots of new students left.

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.194
Yeah.

00:09:29.194 --> 00:09:32.739
In front of the auditorium would be good.
Before they're scouted by other platoons.

00:09:32.739 --> 00:09:35.075
New students, please
assemble at the main auditorium.

00:09:35.075 --> 00:09:36.826
I'm not gonna make it!

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:38.411
We're too late.

00:09:38.411 --> 00:09:41.539
Most of the new students
are already in the auditorium.

00:09:41.539 --> 00:09:44.125
Let's come again once the
entrance ceremony's over.

00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:46.044
Yeah, let's.

00:09:48.338 --> 00:09:51.549
I'm with "Weekly Look'N"
magazine. Mind if I take your picture?

00:09:51.549 --> 00:09:54.719
Oh, I already did. Sorry.

00:09:54.719 --> 00:09:59.974
Nice to meet you. You don't have a uniform,
but are you a new student? What's your name?

00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:02.435
Layfon Alseif.

00:10:02.435 --> 00:10:05.063
Um, what's "Weekly Look'N"?

00:10:05.063 --> 00:10:07.190
It's an informational magazine,

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:10.485
the number one seller in
bookstores around Zuellni Academic City.

00:10:10.485 --> 00:10:15.657
I'm working on a "Who's the Number One
Most Handsome Uniformed Student?" feature now,

00:10:15.657 --> 00:10:18.410
so do you mind if I ask you a couple questions?

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.161
Hey, fake reporter!

00:10:20.161 --> 00:10:21.788
Zoinks!

00:10:23.164 --> 00:10:25.125
Don't call me a fake!

00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:26.960
Working on your story, looking all smug...

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.295
You only just got here, didn't you?

00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:32.966
Yes, true enough, I'm a new
student too. And to be honest,

00:10:32.966 --> 00:10:38.346
I haven't sold the article yet, so
calling myself a reporter isn't quite...

00:10:38.346 --> 00:10:41.766
However! Just watch, I'll be
a great reporter in the future.

00:10:41.766 --> 00:10:46.021
I'm plenty confident in my story,
so it'll be okay! Just leave it to--!

00:10:48.064 --> 00:10:50.316
Sorry if she's spoiled the mood.

00:10:50.316 --> 00:10:54.529
When it comes to spirit, she has twice as
much as anyone else. Please forgive this.

00:10:54.529 --> 00:10:57.157
While we're here, allow me to introduce us!

00:10:57.157 --> 00:11:00.035
I'm Mifi Rotten! My hobby is karaoke.

00:11:00.035 --> 00:11:05.373
And! This is my childhood friend Naruki
Gelni, and over here is May-shen Trinden.

00:11:05.373 --> 00:11:06.624
Nice to meet you.

00:11:06.624 --> 00:11:11.963
We're from Yortem Transit City.
Where are you from, Layfon?

00:11:18.803 --> 00:11:19.971
A fight, you say?

00:11:19.971 --> 00:11:21.181
What, some new students?

00:11:21.181 --> 00:11:22.098
Somebody stop them!

00:11:22.098 --> 00:11:24.434
C'mon, do it!

00:11:24.434 --> 00:11:25.727
Kei energy?

00:11:25.727 --> 00:11:27.812
Ooh, a scoop!

00:11:27.812 --> 00:11:30.106
Mii-<i>chan</i>, it's dangerous!

00:11:44.079 --> 00:11:46.247
Who would've thought I'd
stumble across a scene like this?!

00:11:46.247 --> 00:11:50.043
But for two members of the Military
Arts Department to be fighting outside...

00:11:50.752 --> 00:11:52.087
Restoration!

00:11:52.087 --> 00:11:53.380
He's got a dite!

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.756
It can't be!

00:11:54.756 --> 00:11:56.007
--Things are heatin' up!
--This is bad.

00:11:56.007 --> 00:11:58.885
Even the municipal police
can't stop a military artist.

00:11:58.885 --> 00:12:00.512
I'll go get a senior military student.

00:12:00.512 --> 00:12:02.597
And till then, I'll grab some info for a story!

00:12:02.597 --> 00:12:04.224
Mii-<i>chan</i>!

00:12:12.774 --> 00:12:14.401
Restoration!

00:12:22.951 --> 00:12:23.952
May-cchi!

00:12:23.952 --> 00:12:25.578
Danger.

00:12:29.916 --> 00:12:32.335
Someone help her.

00:12:51.021 --> 00:12:52.939
Gorneo. It's him, isn't it?

00:12:53.356 --> 00:12:54.983
He's Layfon, right?

00:12:55.692 --> 00:12:56.693
Yeah.

00:12:56.693 --> 00:12:57.152
Over there!

00:12:57.152 --> 00:12:59.237
You all, stop it!

00:13:17.589 --> 00:13:19.174
With your permission...

00:13:19.174 --> 00:13:21.176
Welcome.

00:13:21.176 --> 00:13:23.720
I am Kalian Loss, student council president.

00:13:26.473 --> 00:13:30.435
Can't we take a break from training for at
least the day of the entrance ceremony?

00:13:30.435 --> 00:13:33.772
Senior Sharnid and Felli
aren't even coming, you know.

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:36.608
Harley... What do you think about him?

00:13:37.275 --> 00:13:38.443
"Him"?

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.237
The new student who stopped the fight earlier.

00:13:41.237 --> 00:13:43.114
Nina, don't tell me...

00:13:43.114 --> 00:13:48.119
He wasn't even wearing a uniform. He's
probably in the General Education Department.

00:13:48.119 --> 00:13:51.331
It looks like Mr. Student Council
President has already called for him.

00:13:51.539 --> 00:13:53.958
He might even be expelled.

00:13:53.958 --> 00:13:54.751
What?!

00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:55.585
Why didn't you say so?

00:13:55.585 --> 00:13:57.045
Handle this for me!

00:13:59.756 --> 00:14:01.466
Nice catch!

00:14:01.466 --> 00:14:05.053
Hey, be careful with this!

00:14:07.097 --> 00:14:12.435
As you know, Zuellni Academic
City is operated solely by students.

00:14:12.435 --> 00:14:16.940
Thus, I essentially control everything.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.819
The power of final authority lies with me.

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:26.199
Still, that a General Education
student like you, and a freshman,

00:14:26.199 --> 00:14:30.829
could so easily beat students
of the Military Arts Department...

00:14:30.829 --> 00:14:33.415
You have knowledge of the fighting arts?

00:14:33.748 --> 00:14:35.917
To a certain extent.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:43.717
Layfon Alseif. A working student. Your work
is... cleaning for the machinery department.

00:14:43.717 --> 00:14:45.802
It pays well, but the work is hard.

00:14:46.678 --> 00:14:49.597
Also, your scholarship money is at D ranking.

00:14:49.597 --> 00:14:52.851
I think your tuition will
take most of what you earn.

00:14:52.851 --> 00:14:54.602
I'm aware of that.

00:14:54.602 --> 00:14:57.105
Six years of this will be quite demanding...

00:14:57.105 --> 00:14:59.107
I'm confident I have the physical strength.

00:14:59.107 --> 00:15:03.153
I am thinking of moving you
to the Military Arts Department.

00:15:03.153 --> 00:15:08.074
Your stipend would become an A
ranking and your tuition would be waived.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.119
I don't think these are unfavorable conditions.

00:15:12.037 --> 00:15:15.665
Wait just a moment! I'm not
interested in the Military Arts Department.

00:15:15.665 --> 00:15:18.877
For the past two years,
Zuellni has lost sernium mines

00:15:18.877 --> 00:15:22.672
through defeat in the municipal
challenges, leaving it now with just one.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.217
In other words, there are no more chances.

00:15:26.217 --> 00:15:30.180
Right now, Zuellni needs the kind
of fighting strength that you possess.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:34.934
I came here to pursue normal studies.

00:15:35.226 --> 00:15:39.939
That's assuming that this school,
that Zuellni can continue to exist.

00:15:39.939 --> 00:15:42.275
This is not a proposal.

00:15:42.275 --> 00:15:43.151
What do you--

00:15:43.151 --> 00:15:45.278
Pardon me.

00:15:45.904 --> 00:15:47.530
Begin.

00:15:50.241 --> 00:15:54.120
He is an important guest.
Treat him with hospitality.

00:15:54.537 --> 00:15:55.163
Yes, sir.

00:15:55.163 --> 00:15:56.539
Wait a minute!

00:15:56.539 --> 00:15:57.999
I'll do that myself!

00:15:57.999 --> 00:15:59.376
Yaay!

00:16:01.211 --> 00:16:05.256
With permission, Mr. President,
I come to request of you...

00:16:09.302 --> 00:16:12.180
You are the leader of the 17th Platoon.

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:16.810
I'm in the middle of something right now,
but... Ah, you seem to be in a hurry, uh...

00:16:16.935 --> 00:16:21.773
Nina Antalk. My request is that I take this...

00:16:21.773 --> 00:16:24.442
What's your name, maggot?

00:16:24.609 --> 00:16:25.777
It's Layfon.

00:16:26.069 --> 00:16:29.614
What may I help you with, Nina Antalk-<i>kun</i>?

00:16:29.614 --> 00:16:34.244
Please let me have Layfon!

00:16:45.088 --> 00:16:47.966
All right, see you
tomorrow at the training room.

00:16:47.966 --> 00:16:51.636
The men's dorms are that way. See you.

00:16:52.679 --> 00:16:55.515
That military uniform suits you!

00:17:08.445 --> 00:17:10.071
Huh?

00:17:21.541 --> 00:17:24.627
Worthless. Worthless.

00:17:28.423 --> 00:17:32.218
Dammit! Don't think I'm just gonna let this go!

00:17:32.218 --> 00:17:33.011
Huh?

00:17:33.011 --> 00:17:34.888
Help her.

00:17:37.974 --> 00:17:39.559
Cowardly vermin!

00:17:39.559 --> 00:17:46.066
I'll [BEEP] you, and [BEEP] you
and then I'll friggin' [BEEP] you!

00:17:48.193 --> 00:17:49.694
Um...

00:17:49.694 --> 00:17:52.113
Did you hear that?

00:17:52.113 --> 00:17:53.365
Uh, yes.

00:17:53.365 --> 00:17:59.371
When I'm so angry I can't stand it,
hurling abuse at this hole makes me feel better.

00:18:01.623 --> 00:18:04.709
Um, could you be the person
who sent me that nen'i energy earlier

00:18:04.709 --> 00:18:07.754
and let me know what was happening?

00:18:11.049 --> 00:18:13.927
Did you transfer to the
Military Arts Department?

00:18:13.927 --> 00:18:18.390
Not so much transfer as,
I was forced to transfer.

00:18:25.021 --> 00:18:29.526
That badge... You're in the
17th Platoon as well, aren't you?

00:18:49.504 --> 00:18:52.257
Ta-daa! I'm on a roll!

00:18:52.257 --> 00:18:56.386
No doubt about it, next week's sales of
Look'N will be twice as much as usual!

00:18:57.637 --> 00:19:00.390
Fine, let's just hurry and go to bed.

00:19:01.599 --> 00:19:05.478
May-cchi, your face is red.
Do you feel light-headed?

00:19:06.438 --> 00:19:08.440
I'm all right.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:12.777
Yeah, I know you're not sick.

00:19:12.777 --> 00:19:16.072
You're all red because of <i>him</i>!

00:19:23.079 --> 00:19:26.291
May-cchi! Get a hold of yourself!

00:19:26.291 --> 00:19:28.710
She's got it pretty bad, huh?

00:19:33.256 --> 00:19:36.760
My older brother and... Who are they?

00:19:46.394 --> 00:19:48.021
Scum.

00:20:07.791 --> 00:20:10.210
Are you trying to kill me, Savalis-<i>san</i>?!

00:20:10.752 --> 00:20:14.673
If you could die that easily,
it might be your best quality.

00:20:33.608 --> 00:20:34.526
It can't be...

00:20:34.526 --> 00:20:36.653
This bugger doesn't give up, does he?

00:20:36.653 --> 00:20:39.364
The more we attack it, the
harder we make things for ourselves!

00:20:39.364 --> 00:20:40.657
At this rate, this will never end!

00:20:40.657 --> 00:20:45.370
Inbeeku would seem to be a colonial life form

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:48.289
composed of matter such
as cells or something smaller.

00:20:48.289 --> 00:20:51.042
I get it. It didn't blow itself up...

00:20:51.042 --> 00:20:54.379
It acted out of self preservation, to
reconnect itself with the main body, eh?

00:20:54.379 --> 00:20:57.048
Through ultra high-pressure attacks
delivered in a short amount of time,

00:20:57.048 --> 00:20:59.467
all of Inbeeku will be crushed to death.

00:20:59.467 --> 00:21:00.844
The whole thing at the same time...

00:21:00.844 --> 00:21:03.972
Everyone, fire off techniques while
employing the greatest amount of kei.

00:21:03.972 --> 00:21:06.391
If we don't stop it on the
first try, we won't get another.

00:21:06.391 --> 00:21:08.393
Let's go!

00:21:16.943 --> 00:21:20.405
You could try to escape up
here, but it'd do you no good!

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:00.153
Well... Whatever works,
right? So long as they win.

00:22:00.153 --> 00:22:04.157
What are you saying?! For a Heaven's
Blade, it is only natural that one employs

00:22:04.157 --> 00:22:07.077
unmatched power and technique
to result in overwhelming victory.

00:22:07.077 --> 00:22:08.787
You're a pain, old man, a big pain...

00:22:08.787 --> 00:22:09.245
--What?

00:22:09.245 --> 00:22:10.622
--Shut up!
--What?

00:22:10.622 --> 00:22:15.168
Just wave that Heaven's Blade of
yours around, and yourself while you're at it.

00:22:15.168 --> 00:22:20.173
Like a child with a new toy,
given that you are a child.

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:32.310
<i>We live in worlds called Regios.</i>

00:22:33.436 --> 00:22:37.023
<i>This fact becomes even</i>
<i>clearer when someone leaves.</i>

00:22:37.607 --> 00:22:41.236
<i>But I can't just be lonely.</i>

00:22:41.236 --> 00:22:45.740
<i>Right now, I want to</i>
<i>respect your feelings, Layfon,</i>

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:48.743
<i>for wanting to start all over again.</i>

00:22:52.288 --> 00:22:55.500
<i>One day, once again...</i>

00:23:41.212 --> 00:23:46.217
<i>I pray you can step foot on Glendan soil. </i>

00:24:03.193 --> 00:24:06.071
<i>Beyond memory</i>

00:24:06.071 --> 00:24:14.621
<i>A map of the ideal future</i>
<i>you'd been searching for</i>

00:24:14.621 --> 00:24:25.674
<i>Scared of something, not</i>
<i>understanding, trembling alone</i>

00:24:25.674 --> 00:24:37.102
<i>Unable to see you, </i>
<i>I'm always wearing a fake smile</i>

00:24:37.102 --> 00:24:46.027
<i>I was held in your arms</i>

00:24:46.027 --> 00:24:51.700
<i>Fall in love like</i>
<i>you're waking up</i>

00:24:51.700 --> 00:24:57.247
<i>And then take me into dreamland</i>

00:24:57.247 --> 00:25:02.919
<i>You always, you always</i>

00:25:02.919 --> 00:25:11.678
<i>You always told me tender lies</i>

00:25:22.272 --> 00:25:24.941
<i>Layfon, who has been</i>
<i>assigned to the 17th Platoon,</i>

00:25:24.941 --> 00:25:27.235
<i>tackles his first competition at Zuellni.</i>

00:25:27.235 --> 00:25:28.945
<i>While the platoon members lack cohesion,</i>

00:25:28.945 --> 00:25:32.323
<i>platoon leader Nina has</i>
<i>her heart set on victory.</i>

00:25:32.323 --> 00:25:34.534
<i>Next time, "Capture the Flag!" and...</i>

00:25:34.534 --> 00:25:36.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
